Package: omx-clap-host
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLAP plugin host for JACK, controlled over mod-host's socket protocol
 omx-clap-host runs CLAP plugins as JACK clients and is controlled like
 mod-host: the same socket, the same line protocol and the same command
 replies, from mod-host's protocol library. Each plugin instance is a JACK
 client with its own ports, and a MIDI input port for an instrument.
 .
 omx-clap-scan lists the plugins of a CLAP bundle, in a process of its own so
 that a plugin that crashes on load is reported and does not take the caller
 down.
 .
 The CLAP hosting core it runs plugins on is libomx-clap-core0.

Package: libomx-clap-core0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLAP hosting core of omx-clap-host, shared library
 The library omx-clap-host and the openmixer console's in-process CLAP host
 both run plugins on: the control thread that loads, judges, activates and
 warms a CLAP plugin up and owns its parameters and state, and the RT body
 that runs its process() on the caller's thread. It names no JACK and no
 socket.

Package: libomx-clap-core-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libomx-clap-core0 (= ${binary:Version}), clap-headers, pkgconf, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLAP hosting core of omx-clap-host, development files
 The headers under include/omx-clap-host, the pkg-config file, the export
 list of libomx-clap-core.so.0 and the ABI baseline of the release, for a
 program that hosts CLAP plugins on the library.
